# Third Book — Chapter Drafts

Chapter drafts for the third book land here, one file per chapter (same
convention as `public/drafting/`). This folder is intentionally empty until
the drafting pass begins — see `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-15-third-book-design.md`
for the chapter structure.

Note: this file is named `README` with no extension on purpose. `book-mash-3.toml`
sets `chapters_glob = "public/drafting-3/*.md"`, and `book-mash` (see
`book_mash/corpus/loader.py`) globs and measures every `.md` file it matches with
no filtering — it does not error or skip non-chapter files. A `README.md` (or any
other `*.md` file) placed directly in this folder gets silently treated as a
phantom chapter and gets judge calls planned/run against it. Do not rename this
back to `README.md` or add other `*.md` files here that aren't real chapter
drafts. `scripts/test_third_book_track.py` fails if one appears.
